<title>USA: Nichols gets $103.9 mln defense contract.</title>
<headline>Nichols gets $103.9 mln defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTSVILLE, Ala. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nichols Research Corp said Wednesday it won a three-year 103.9 million defense contract.</p>
<p>The company said it and its subcontractors will provide system engineering, integration and simulation services to the U.S. Army Aviation and Missile Command.</p>
<p>Nichol's stock traded at 23-15/16 Wednesday afternoon, up 15/16.</p>
